WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.2 · Strategic Foundations
Context and landscape analysis

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Look outward at the landscape before you commit time, savings or a legal form.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Scan political, economic, social and legal trends.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Map who already works here and how well.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Consider joining or partnering instead of starting.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write a context scan and a list of the main actors.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
